WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.789
Welcome to Orbit. A day in my world. Our focus is Present Simple.

2
00:00:06.789 --> 00:00:15.577
Use the present simple for routines. Add s with he, she and it. Use do or does in questions.

3
00:00:15.577 --> 00:00:18.636
She does not study on Sundays.

4
00:00:18.636 --> 00:00:21.340
Do your lessons start at nine?

5
00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:24.339
My brother reads books after school.

6
00:00:24.339 --> 00:00:33.737
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
